<div class="fn" id="_fn_p46"><p>Abbreviations: AD, atopic dermatitis; BSA, body surface area; BMI, body mass index (calculated as weight in kilograms divided by height in meters squared); CDLQI, Children’s Dermatology Life Quality Index; DLQI, Dermatology Life Quality Index; EASI, Eczema Area and Severity Index; IGA, Investigator Global Assessment; IgE, immunoglobulin E (for mg/L, divide by 10); POEM, patient-oriented eczema measure; SCORAD, SCORing of Atopic Dermatitis Index; WI-NRS, Worst Itch−Numeric Rating scale.</p></div>
<div class="fn" id="doi250014t1n1">
<sup>
